    "type": "verse",
    "number": 3,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "hit him -- Cf. 2 Samuel 1:10; 21:12. The order is:\n\n(1) Saul is \"hit\"--wounded mortally, potentially \"slain,\" by the Philistines;\n\n(2) either to escape agony, or insult by the enemy, he falls upon his sword, and his armour-bearer, supposing him to be dead, slew himself;\n\n(3) but Saul was not dead; raising himself upon his spear, he besought the Amalekite to put him to death. 2 Samuel 1:10; 21:12."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 12,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "burnt -- Contra. 2 Chronicles 16:14."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
